Plant: invented BARN-FEN / Mirelatch Compost Tunnel CT-5 (not TRIAD / Meridian / VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS / LYOSHIELD / CINDERWICK / BOGIRON / PUSHERFELL / SKARVOLT / COILSHAW / GIBBSQUERN / SIPHONWOLD / WINDBOXHOLT / LOCKSPUR / SLUICE-HEARTH / WOLD-BARN / QUAY-FEN / LOCK-FEN / FEN-SPIT / BARN-SPIT / SPUR-HEARTH / SPIT-LOCK)

Two densifying cycles. Verbatim headings in order. Trajectory Builder cycle 2
emits the only JSONL line (also written to batch-r05.jsonl).

