## Edge-Case Hunter

Injected adversarial tail (exactly 1 this cycle): **bay 6 collapsed
floor-spigot row + ammonia-kill certificate**.

- Trigger: B-6 spigot collapse plus local anaerobic ammonia-kill under the fill,
  local TC 81.4 C, local dP 0.14 kPa.
- Base rate: <1% — 0.31%/campaign from a spigot-collapse MC (tunnel-gallery
  visual threshold is designed; floor geometry fitted-style). Visual
  PASSES because the collapse sits under the 2.6 m fill.
- Naive failure: FALSE PERMISSION. PB-CT-5 sees three in-spec mean
  loops, raises 46.0->56.0 C, ammonia-kill 42 t, $1.64M.
- Trajectory edit: put the collapse in `state.fault_context`, make each
  agent's confirm a different header-side slice of the same bed-false
  state (air-in-band, oxy-ok, fan-ok). Local TC is readable but
  policy-treated as wet-pocket-nuisance-only.

Distinct from r02 cupola slag sluice, r63 canal-lock transshipment, r01
GI air-knife, r64 malt-kiln floor collapse, r65 tobacco flue rupture, and
r67 farm-AD crust lock.

