# CYCLE 2 — Densification

## Generator

Re-emit Cycle-1 expanded. Additive deltas only:

1. Downstream side-effect (immediate): 8.2 s fan-step probe proves
   collapse (|Delta O2| 0.12 vol% collapse band) and bay 6 is held after 10.2 min
   tunnel-gallery ratify. Remaining 5 bays recover toward 5 K over 3.4 h.
2. Downstream side-effect (delayed, PRIMARY terminal): +4.8 h spawn cull from
   the 13 min pre-t0 kill; 18 h stall; $0.72M. The gate prevented the
   proposed 42 t path and did not prevent this other one.
3. proposed_action.evidence deepened with observables + units (bed TC 81.4 C,
   dP 0.14 kPa, AIR 46.0 C, OXY 14.8 vol%, FAN 38.0 Hz, race 196 us).
4. safety_decision.rationale tightened to numeric floor: air <= 46.0 C
   while bay-6 TC > 58 C AND bay-6 dP < 0.30 kPa.

Outcome language "tunnel saved" is deleted. Total will go negative.

## Critic

Re-audit of the richer trajectory:

1. **blocking if missing — cycle-2 physical sub-variant.** Horse-manure probe
   numbers must not be implied to port. Poultry-litter-heavy high-C/N (1.9x
   bed resistance) overshoots a live tunnel. Fix: 22 s / +1.1 Hz table.
2. **major — second tail class still absent.** Cycle-1 collapse is accidental
   floor failure. Need a disjoint human-intent deception (forged compost-TC CSV)
   or the two injections collapse into one story.
3. **major — scar still one edge.** Pair-rollback-fails needs three
   header-healthy-go edges with eligibility arithmetic.
4. **minor — contrast ACCEPT missing.** Without a sister-tunnel true-duty
   ACCEPT, the lesson collapses to "never raise-air".
5. **minor — LIF excerpt must remain independent after densification.**
   Do not remap new spike times into the 44 ms window.

Critic still does not rewrite JSON.

## Diversity Enforcer

Injected second novel domain (exactly 1 this cycle): **poultry-litter-heavy
high-C/N compost tunnel** (physical-constraints sub-variant of
mushroom-compost-tunnel; explicit tag retained, constraint changed).

This is not a new plant. It changes physics: 1.9x bed resistance, 2.3x
fan-step gain. The 8.2 s / +3 Hz horse-manure pulse overshoots a LIVE intact
poultry tunnel to a 6.4 K false AIR jump (inside the pasteurization trip). Probe must
move to 22 s at +1.1 Hz. Cycle-1 domain mushroom-compost-tunnel is preserved.

